  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0080_ed0a75096e58.jpg\" /><br /><br />Then, <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />or <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> , when the rhombus is a square.<br /><br />Hence, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
